---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="MRV methodology — Terravault"
  description="Every ton is measured, reported, and verified — never modeled."
>
  <section class="tv-container" style="max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:88px 64px 44px;">
    <div data-reveal style="max-width:760px;">
      <div
        style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-size:13px; color:#9ef27a; letter-spacing:0.03em; margin-bottom:22px; border:1px solid rgba(158,242,122,0.25); padding:7px 16px 7px 8px; border-radius:100px; background:rgba(158,242,122,0.06);"
      >
        <span
          style="width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:#9ef27a; box-shadow:0 0 8px #9ef27a; display:block;"
        ></span>Methodology · MRV
      </div>
      <h1
        style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:clamp(38px,5.4vw,58px); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:-0.02em; line-height:1.06; margin-bottom:22px;"
      >
        Every ton is measured, reported, and verified — <em style="font-style:italic; color:#9ef27a;">never modeled</em>
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px; color:#a9a79d; max-width:620px;">
        Our measurement, reporting, and verification protocol is the reason a Terravault ton
        survives diligence. This is how a molecule of CO&#8322; becomes a credit you can defend.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tv-container" style="max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:20px 64px 40px;">
    <div
      data-reveal
      style="position:relative; height:min(42vw,380px); border-radius:20px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);"
    >
      <img
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1508514177221-188b1cf16e9d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80"
        alt="Metering and monitoring infrastructure"
        style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; filter:saturate(0.85) brightness(0.7);"
        onerror="this.style.display='none'"
      />
      <div
        style="position:absolute; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(9,11,9,0.1) 30%,rgba(9,11,9,0.85) 100%), linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(9,11,9,0.55) 0%,transparent 45%);"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        style="position:absolute; bottom:26px; left:30px; font-size:13.5px; color:#e5e3db; background:rgba(9,11,9,0.5); backdrop-filter:blur(6px); padding:9px 16px; border-radius:100px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;"
      >
        <span
          style="width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:#9ef27a; box-shadow:0 0 8px #9ef27a; display:block;"
        ></span>Continuous flow metering · Facility 02
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tv-container" style="max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:60px 64px;">
    <div data-reveal style="max-width:640px; margin-bottom:44px;">
      <div style="font-size:13px; color:#9ef27a; letter-spacing:0.05em; margin-bottom:14px; font-weight:600;">
        The measurement chain
      </div>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,38px); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:-0.01em; margin-bottom:14px;">
        Three meters, one reconciled number
      </h2>
      <p style="color:#a9a79d; font-size:16px;">
        CO&#8322; is metered at every point it moves. Nothing is estimated between them.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal class="tv-grid-3" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px;">
      <div style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:16px; background:linear-gradient(160deg,#12160f,#0d100e); padding:32px;">
        <div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:24px; color:#9ef27a; margin-bottom:16px;">M1</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:18px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:10px;">Capture meter</h3>
        <p style="color:#918f86; font-size:14.5px;">Mass-flow sensors log concentrated CO&#8322; leaving each contactor in real time, calibrated weekly against a reference gas.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:16px; background:linear-gradient(160deg,#12160f,#0d100e); padding:32px;">
        <div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:24px; color:#9ef27a; margin-bottom:16px;">M2</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:18px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:10px;">Injection meter</h3>
        <p style="color:#918f86; font-size:14.5px;">A second independent meter records exactly what enters the wellhead for mineralization — the ton that actually goes underground.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:16px; background:linear-gradient(160deg,#12160f,#0d100e); padding:32px;">
        <div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:24px; color:#9ef27a; margin-bottom:16px;">M3</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:18px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:10px;">Reconciliation</h3>
        <p style="color:#918f86; font-size:14.5px;">Capture and injection totals are reconciled hourly. Any variance beyond 0.5% flags the batch for review before a credit is issued.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tv-container" style="max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:40px 64px;">
    <div
      data-reveal
      style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:20px; background:linear-gradient(160deg,#0f130d,#0b0d0b); padding:44px 40px;"
    >
      <div style="font-size:12.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#9ef27a; margin-bottom:8px;">
        From gross capture to a defensible credit
      </div>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,32px); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:-0.01em; margin-bottom:28px;">
        What we subtract before we count a ton
      </h2>
      <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0;">
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto; gap:24px; padding:16px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); align-items:center;"><div><div style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600;">Gross CO&#8322; captured &amp; injected</div><div style="font-size:13px; color:#918f86; margin-top:2px;">Reconciled meter total</div></div><div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:22px;">1.000 t</div></div>
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto; gap:24px; padding:16px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); align-items:center;"><div><div style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600;">Energy &amp; process emissions</div><div style="font-size:13px; color:#918f86; margin-top:2px;">Grid, heat, and on-site combustion, full lifecycle</div></div><div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:22px; color:#e0956b;">− 0.11 t</div></div>
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto; gap:24px; padding:16px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); align-items:center;"><div><div style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600;">Transport &amp; injection</div><div style="font-size:13px; color:#918f86; margin-top:2px;">Compression, pumping, and wellhead energy</div></div><div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:22px; color:#e0956b;">− 0.02 t</div></div>
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto; gap:24px; padding:20px 0 4px; align-items:center;"><div><div style="font-size:15px; font-weight:700;">Net durable removal credited</div><div style="font-size:13px; color:#918f86; margin-top:2px;">The only number we sell</div></div><div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:30px; color:#9ef27a;">0.87 t</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tv-container" style="max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:60px 64px;">
    <div data-reveal class="tv-split" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:48px; align-items:start;">
      <div>
        <div style="font-size:13px; color:#9ef27a; letter-spacing:0.05em; margin-bottom:14px; font-weight:600;">
          Permanence monitoring
        </div>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,34px); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:-0.01em; margin-bottom:16px;">
          We keep watching after the ton is stored
        </h2>
        <p style="color:#a9a79d; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:20px;">
          Mineralization converts CO&#8322; to solid carbonate rock in under two years. We
          monitor the reservoir long after, so permanence is observed, not assumed.
        </p>
        <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;">
          <div style="display:flex; gap:12px;"><span style="color:#9ef27a; margin-top:1px;">✓</span><span style="font-size:14.5px; color:#c8c6bd;">Seismic sensors track reservoir integrity in real time</span></div>
          <div style="display:flex; gap:12px;"><span style="color:#9ef27a; margin-top:1px;">✓</span><span style="font-size:14.5px; color:#c8c6bd;">Core samples confirm carbonate formation on a fixed cadence</span></div>
          <div style="display:flex; gap:12px;"><span style="color:#9ef27a; margin-top:1px;">✓</span><span style="font-size:14.5px; color:#c8c6bd;">Groundwater geochemistry checked quarterly for the life of the site</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:16px; background:linear-gradient(160deg,#12160f,#0d100e); padding:36px;">
        <div style="font-size:12.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#918f86; margin-bottom:24px;">
          Reporting cadence
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0;">
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:16px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);"><span style="font-size:14.5px; color:#c8c6bd;">Meter reconciliation</span><span style="font-size:13.5px; color:#9ef27a;">Hourly</span></div>
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:16px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);"><span style="font-size:14.5px; color:#c8c6bd;">Credit issuance</span><span style="font-size:13.5px; color:#9ef27a;">Monthly</span></div>
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:16px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);"><span style="font-size:14.5px; color:#c8c6bd;">Buyer retirement report</span><span style="font-size:13.5px; color:#9ef27a;">Quarterly</span></div>
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:16px 0;"><span style="font-size:14.5px; color:#c8c6bd;">Independent third-party audit</span><span style="font-size:13.5px; color:#9ef27a;">Annual</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tv-container" style="max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:40px 64px;">
    <div
      data-reveal
      style="position:relative; height:min(42vw,380px); border-radius:20px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);"
    >
      <img
        src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/2569842/pexels-photo-2569842.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1600"
        alt="Metering infrastructure"
        style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; filter:saturate(0.82) brightness(0.6);"
        onerror="this.style.display='none'"
      />
      <div
        style="position:absolute; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(9,11,9,0.18) 25%,rgba(9,11,9,0.82) 100%), linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(9,11,9,0.5) 0%,transparent 52%);"
      >
      </div>
      <div style="position:absolute; bottom:28px; left:32px; max-width:520px;">
        <div style="font-size:12.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#9ef27a; margin-bottom:8px;">
          At the meter
        </div>
        <div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:clamp(18px,2.2vw,26px); color:#f4f2ec; line-height:1.35;">
          Mass-flow sensors, calibrated weekly against a reference gas.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tv-container" style="max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:40px 64px 20px;">
    <div data-reveal style="max-width:640px; margin-bottom:32px;">
      <div style="font-size:13px; color:#9ef27a; letter-spacing:0.05em; margin-bottom:14px; font-weight:600;">
        Standards
      </div>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,34px); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:-0.01em;">
        Protocols we conform to
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden;">
      <div class="tv-split" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:1px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.07);">
        <div style="background:#0d100e; padding:22px 28px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; font-size:14.5px;"><span style="font-weight:600;">Isometric DAC + Storage</span><span style="font-size:12.5px; color:#9ef27a; padding:4px 12px; border-radius:100px; background:rgba(158,242,122,0.1);">Certified</span></div>
        <div style="background:#0d100e; padding:22px 28px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; font-size:14.5px;"><span style="font-weight:600;">Puro.earth CO&#8322; Removal</span><span style="font-size:12.5px; color:#9ef27a; padding:4px 12px; border-radius:100px; background:rgba(158,242,122,0.1);">Certified</span></div>
        <div style="background:#0d100e; padding:22px 28px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; font-size:14.5px;"><span style="font-weight:600;">ISO 14064-2 GHG</span><span style="font-size:12.5px; color:#9ef27a; padding:4px 12px; border-radius:100px; background:rgba(158,242,122,0.1);">Conformant</span></div>
        <div style="background:#0d100e; padding:22px 28px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; font-size:14.5px;"><span style="font-weight:600;">45Q tax credit</span><span style="font-size:12.5px; color:#9ef27a; padding:4px 12px; border-radius:100px; background:rgba(158,242,122,0.1);">Qualified</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    data-reveal
    class="tv-container"
    style="text-align:center; padding:110px 64px; background:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 60% at 50% 50%, rgba(158,242,122,0.08), transparent 70%);"
  >
    <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,44px); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:-0.01em; margin-bottom:16px;">
      Read the full protocol
    </h2>
    <p style="color:#a9a79d; max-width:480px; margin:0 auto 40px;">
      The complete MRV methodology, calibration logs, and monitoring data live in the data
      room, available to evaluators under NDA.
    </p>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:14px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <a
        href="/data-room"
        class="btn-primary"
        style="display:inline-block; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#b4f792,#1d9e75); color:#06210f; padding:15px 30px; border-radius:100px; font-weight:700; font-size:15px;"
        >Open the data room</a
      >
      <a
        href="/verification-report"
        class="btn-secondary"
        style="display:inline-block; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16); padding:15px 30px; border-radius:100px; font-weight:600; font-size:15px; color:#f4f2ec;"
        >See the verification report</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
